{
 "_about": "Quest mode: a journey down the Oshu Kaido from Aomori to Edo. Each stop is one game; win it to travel on. 'rules' are changes to rules.json for that game only (nested keys change just what they name). 'rival' is how the bot plays: depth = the longest cure it looks for (5 = full strength), tools/curse = false stops it buying tools or cursing, headStart = mon it starts with. 'at' is [longitude, latitude] on the journey map. Place names and lines are in the language file under quest.stops.",
