  "_about": "The journey map. 'svg' is the land drawing (its <path class=\"land\"> and <path class=\"border\"> shapes are used, in its own viewBox). 'project' turns [longitude, latitude] into that drawing's coordinates: x = a*lon + b*lat + c for each row, fitted to six capes from Soya to Nojimazaki (about 4 units out at most).",
